                + "Exhaust a card, deal 1 damage to a random enemy.",
            ["LEDGER_OF_SUNKEN_NAMES.pages.CONFRONT.description"] =
                "Obtain Sunken Keepsake (Forgotten Soul relic): whenever you "
                + "Exhaust a card, deal 1 damage to a random enemy.",
            ["LEDGER_OF_SUNKEN_NAMES.pages.ACCEPT.description"] =
